.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-KNOT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-knot \- Assert Turtle facts, validated against loaded shapes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu knot\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-\-blank\-node\-scope\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfile.ttl\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Assert Turtle facts, validated against loaded shapes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-shapes\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Shapes used for validation or packaging
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph IRI for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time timestamp for the operation
.TP
\fB\-\-blank\-node\-scope\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Blank\-node identity scope for this import
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfile.ttl\fR>

